data: {"id": "8241a340670d4f10-final", "run_id": "8241a340670d4f10", "seq": 1063, "ts_ms": 1789370146817, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v13/workload` | Terminating | Pod `workload` 的容器进程被配置为在收到 SIGTERM 后仅打印日志而不调用 `exit()`，导致进程未在 terminationGracePeriodSeconds (3900s) 宽限期内执行退出逻辑，从而卡死在 Terminating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod | `pod.status`: Terminating, `pod.phase`: Running | 确认 Pod 处于终止卡死状态，未进入 Finished |\n| 2 | K8s State | Pod | `pod.condition` (Ready, ContainersReady): True | 确认 Pod 在异常前处于健康就绪状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Stopping container app` | 确认 Kubernetes 试图停止容器进程 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Readiness probe failed: ... timed out` | 确认健康检查失效，与进程僵死状态一致 |\n| 5 | Logging | es | `SIGTERM received; waiting` | 捕获到应用层收到终止信号并挂起等待 |\n\n日志捕获到收到 `SIGTERM` 后进程进入 `waiting` 状态，配合 K8s 层面的终止事件和就绪探针失败，构成“进程收到信号但未正常退出”的完整证据链。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器进程未实现 SIGTERM 处理逻辑(仅等待) → 进程无法在宽限期内正常退出 → Pod 状态僵死(Terminating) → 就绪探针失败/不可访问\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod `workload` 的容器进程在处理 `SIGTERM` 信号时存在逻辑缺陷。证据显示应用层收到终止信号后仅输出“等待”日志而不调用退出逻辑，导致 Pod 在宽限期内卡在 Terminating 状态且就绪探针超时（引用证据 5 与证据 4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v13/workload: 39.9s (Evidence 32.5s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 5.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v13/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 65.081, "metrics": {"run_id": "8241a340670d4f10", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 65.0852541923523, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 65085.254192352295, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 60794.07215118408, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 10102.333784103394, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3834.9051475524902}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19274.57332611084, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 39864.77327346802, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 5912.945508956909, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

